  "_approach": "Two-bar escalation of the tribal tom-tumble motif from ukfunky_tom_tumble_fill_01: a high-to-low tom cascade phrased on the tresillo thickens each bar while congas double the hits, the floor breaking away from 4x4 into pure tresillo kicks and then dropping its last beat, cowbell driving the tresillo pulse harder in bar 2, and a crash plus low-tom accent land together on the final 16th before the drop. Ref: the docs' tom-tumble fill (approach 10), the DJ Gregory/Karizma tribal-house tom language behind ukfunky_tribal_conga_01.",
